From: MPLAPACK maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] Add correctly rounded finite cu_freal division and sqrt

Against mpc_cuda abd9407 (0.0.1). Add cu_fdiv_rn/cu_sqrt_rn without changing
cu_fmath or operators. Newton at PB+64 uses a conservative 64-ulp filter;
ambiguous results use exact integer midpoint products and ties-to-even.
Host/device MPFR comparison tests and benchmarks are carried by MPLAPACK
in mpblas/optimized/mpfr/cuda/test/cu_fround_test.cpp. See patches/README.md
for reproducible commands, limitations and verification status.

